<title>THAILAND: Industrial Finance 1996 net higher.</title>
<headline>Industrial Finance 1996 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited consolidated financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		5.43	vs	     4.72</p>
<p>    Net		   2,960.40	vs	 2,570.32</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Industrial Finance Corp of Thailand, a finance firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
